rms to be decided later (proposed; recovered, blank in the baseline; ~377% of mcap).","**Elitecon International** — board approves a QIP enabling resolution to raise **up to Rs 1,000 crore**, price and terms to be set later, subject to shareholder approval (proposed; recovered, blank in the baseline; ~87% of mcap)."],"equity_allotments":["**Garg Furnace** — allots 13,98,000 fresh preferential warrants at Rs 126.50 to promoters and non-promoters, including marquee investor Saket Agarwal (30,000 warrants), for **Rs 17.68 crore**; a new-warrant issue, not a past conversion.","**TD Power Systems** — allots 77,41,935 QIP shares at Rs 775 to qualified institutional buyers, for **Rs 599.99 crore**.","**Nazara Technologies** — allots 2,38,81,711 preferential equity shares for **Rs 129.35 crore**.","**Koura Fine Diamond Jewelry** — allots 6,00,000 preferential convertible warrants at Rs 37 to promoters and non-promoters, for **Rs 2.22 crore** (SME; ~7.8% of mcap)."],"m_and_a":["**Tavexia Lifecare** (formerly Sattva Sukun Lifecare) — approves a **60% controlling stake in Meyonex Pharmaceuticals for Rs 67.19 crore**, via a cash subscription of 2,09,97,180 fresh equity shares at Rs 32 each, alongside a rebrand into APIs, CDMO/CRAMS and nutraceuticals _(~147.2% of mcap)_.","**Bhagyanagar India** — monetises its IDA Uppal, Hyderabad land via a hybrid MoU with Om Sree Builders and Developers: an **outright sale of 1.50 acres for Rs 60 crore**, plus joint development of the remaining 2.65 acres for a 30% share of ~3 lakh sq ft of developed area.","**Bajaj Healthcare** — completes a slump sale of its Dahej Industrial Area plot, via a Deed of Assignment with Spa Vet Private Limited and Indosol Pure Technologies, for a consideration of **Rs 14.67 crore**. _(Corrects the baseline, which tagged this a merger/demerger.)_"],"business_updates":["**Results season** — 26 companies filed results / earnings-call material today (press releases, recordings, transcripts, presentations) — tracked 